            "y": 8,
            "width": 672,
            "height": 112,
            "content": "## ⚠️ Self-provoking trigger flow\n\nThe top lane creates a **pending** test order and marks it as paid (`orderMarkAsPaid`) one minute after the start — keep the first **Wait**: it lets the webhook subscription become active. The order must not be created as paid: orders/paid fires on the transition to paid. The test order is deleted after `AfterAll`."
